00:06:03,529 --> 00:06:09,529
In their town, you don't screw with the law, the law screws with you.

2
00:12:07,058 --> 00:12:13,058
Super Troopers is a comedy, crime, mystery film directed by Jay Chandrasekhar.

3
00:18:10,588 --> 00:18:16,588
Five bored, occasionally high and always ineffective Vermont state troopers
must prove their worth to the governor or lose their jobs.

4
00:24:14,117 --> 00:24:20,117
After stumbling on a drug ring, they plan to make a bust, but a
rival police force is out to steal the glory.

5
