11
01:06:38,823 --> 01:06:44,823
Super Troopers is a 2001 American comedy film directed by Jay Chandrasekhar and written by and starring the Broken
Lizard comedy group (Chandrasekhar, Kevin Heffernan, Steve Lemme, Paul Soter and Erik Stolhanske).

12
01:12:42,352 --> 01:12:48,352
Marisa Coughlan, Daniel von Bargen and Brian Cox co-star
while Lynda Carter has a cameo appearance.

13
01:18:45,882 --> 01:18:51,882
In total, Fox Searchlight paid $3.25 million for distribution rights of
the film and it grossed $23 million at the box office.

14
01:24:49,411 --> 01:24:55,411
A sequel, Super Troopers 2, was released on April 20, 2018.

15
01:30:52,941 --> 01:30:58,941
The film explores themes of alcohol, police chief, highway, radio, cop.

16
01:36:56,470 --> 01:37:02,470
The tone is lighthearted and mind_bending.
